      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Recto",
          "value": "\n<ol dir=\"ltr\"><li>Register of the carpets found in</li>\n<li>the synagogue of the Iraq\u012bs, Mar\u1e25eshvan 1513 (Sel.):</li>\n<li>a variegated carpet; a red carpet;</li>\n<li>an orange carpet; a yellow carpet; an \u02bfatt\u0101b[\u012b] carpet;</li>\n<li>a gilded one; three \u02bfatt\u0101b\u012b carpets;</li>\n<li>a carpet of the D\u0101r's manufacture; a khanj\u012b (?) carpet, worn out.</li>\n<li>(Total) 11 (items)</li>\n<li>Register of what is found in the synagogue of the Sh\u0101m\u012bs:</li>\n<li>a red, variegated carpet; a wine-colored, variegated carpet;</li>\n<li>two pieces of a Dab\u012bq\u012b kerchief; a <i>n\u012bsh\u0101wur\u012b </i>carpet;</li>\n<li>a red carpet; an \u02bfatt\u0101b\u012b carpet; a kha\u1e63if (black-and-white?) carpet;</li>\n<li>an orange, gilded carpet; a physician's carpet;</li>\n<li>a black, variegated carpet; and a carpet [ ... ], worn out.</li>\n<li>(Total) 13 (items)</li>\n<li>A silver Torah case and two silver crowns; a [Torah] scroll;</li>\n<li>... [its] ...&nbsp; of silver</li>\n<li>... ] for the synagogue ... Damm\u016bh</li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
